tems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4424750,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4424750","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:21Z","value":11,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4920210","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1846651706686629","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Anniversary Sale ends tomorrow!","summary":"Hey Lusties! 💗 Just a little reminder: our Publisher Sale ends tomorrow, October 19. If there's a game you've had your eye on, this is your LAST CHANCE to grab it at a sweet discount 😉 Whatever you take home, we hope you have a very good time with it 😌 Fantasy Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1846018067941674","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Fantasy Games turns 2!❤️Celebrate with our first publisher sale🎂","summary":"Hi Fantasy Gamer ❤️ We're celebrating our second anniversary, and you're invited! 🎂 For the first time, we're bringing our games together in a Fantasy Games Publisher Sale. If you've had your eye on something from our catalogue, this is a good time to treat yourself, in more way than one 😉 Our birthday, your discounts 🎁RIGHT NOW, from October 12th until October 19th, we've prepared a TON of discounts for our games, so go crazy and enjoy as many experiences as you can! A few games to get you star","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1845383656387417","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Moeka: Exposure's Temptation DEMO is out now! 🥳","summary":"Today is a monumental point in Moeka’s life! (And ours as well!🤣)The demo for Moeka: Exposure’s Temptation is up and running on our Steam page!This is the same version that will be going up today on Patreon so, as a small celebration of the demo coming out... Everyone gets to play the new version!BUT WAIT, THERE’S MORE 😏 so…We’ve been BLOWN AWAY by how much you guys have supported us all over social media. From X to Discord to Patreon to the Discord. There have been comments, questions, feedback","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T18:58:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1837955055356904","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Moeka’s First Playable Tech Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Moeka: Exposure’s Temptation — Tech-Demo Release! Hey Fantasy Gamers!This is a big moment for us…Moeka: Exposure’s Temptation now has its first playable tech-demo!For the first time, you’ll be able to try an early playable version of the game, get a feel for the mechanics, explore the current build, and see the direction we’re taking Moeka’s risky little adventure.NOTE: This is not the full demo yet.This tech-demo is an early proof of concept that we’ll keep improving over the next few months. I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T13:51:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356904","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1836506165572466","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Tech-demo out on the 10th!","summary":"Hey everyone! The day is finally here. We have a date for the tech-demo! Next Friday the 10th we'll be releasing it for free here on our discord and on our itch (click on the links for access to either). It's been a lot of work to get here, but finally we have something we can properly let you play around with. For the rest of this week, up to Friday, I'll be making new videos for Discord, X and Itch, going over everthing you've seen so far so we're all on the same page, and then we'll get right","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T13:49:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165572466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1832700592794412","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"Hey again everyone! RDreams again, so let's jump right into it:Tech-demoBig news this week. We’re soon going to be back from our temporary “break” and will be focusing on releasing the tech-demo as soon as possible.I know I kind of used those words wrong last time, so let me clear that up:In roughly the next month, we should have the tech-demo ready. It will be a simple, straightforward example of how the game plays. There are missions, a little progression, NPCs, the map, etc. It’s fully playab","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-16T13:30:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592794412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4424750-1831432155579600","game_id":"steam-4424750","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1","summary":"Hey everyone! I’m RDreams speaking on behalf of ShyGirlTeam and this is our first Devlog! (Something we should have admittedly started quite a long time ago 🤣).My main objective with these bi-weakly blurbs is to give you direct insider information on what we’ve been doing, what we’re working on, what we will be working on and how things change as we advance.Like I mentioned earlier, this is kind of something we should have started to do sooner, as we’ve actually been working on Moeka for about a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T09:51:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155579600","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4424750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4424750":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4424750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4920210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4424750","app_id":4424750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d872e07d98879cb24843c7ce98a72294d51b5260d38ef6455981270fd84bc2f0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"모에카의 숨겨진 관음증이 아닌 노출증